      "severity": "must",
      "text": "`smallIntegerLiteral` accepts negative hexadecimal values, so `0xffffffffffffffff` and `0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF` incorrectly compare equal and merge aggregate calls that SQLite keeps distinct. Fix: require both `0 ≤ value` and `value ≤ 2147483647`, and add a regression case with these spellings."
